!assets/lodes/kcwiki-localization.json
!assets/lodes/kcwiki-quest-req.json
!assets/lodes/kcwiki-routing.json
!assets/lodes/kcwiki-seasonal-voice.json
!assets/lodes/kcwiki-ships.json
!assets/lodes/kcwiki-voice.json
!assets/lodes/map-drop-windows.json
!assets/lodes/map-drops.json
!assets/lodes/map-enemy-comps.json
!assets/lodes/poi-fcd-map.json
!assets/lodes/poi-quest-goal.json
!assets/lodes/quests-scn.json
!assets/lodes/ship-exp.json
!assets/lodes/ship-stats.json
!assets/lodes/subtitle-enemies.json
!assets/lodes/subtitle-ja.json
!assets/lodes/subtitle-npc.json
!assets/lodes/subtitle-zh.json
# <<< bundled-lodes
assets/review/*.json
# 倍卡表原文夹具：上游内容，同样不随仓库分发（测试缺它时自动跳过真实格式那几条）
assets/review/*.wikitext.txt
assets/review/*.raw.txt
assets/review/*.raw.csv
assets/review/*.raw.html
# 审稿单：日中对照的维护者侧材料。**日文原文只能待在这里**——
# 它是参考文献，不入仓、不随分发物（台词域 2026-08-22 的口径）。
assets/review/*.md
